WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,560
Isn’t my figure attractive?

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,560
Lord Ling has a better figure than me

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:07,420
So tempting

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,420
If you don't get out

5
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,420
I can't help but eat you

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:15,660
I will tell Lord Ling about this matter

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,660
It’s not what you want then

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:23,630
This time it's wings

9
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,630
Next time it’s the brain

10
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:28,020
Get out of here

11
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,080
What a good mother-in-law!

12
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,080
How wonderful

13
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,140
Wonderful yarn

14
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:38,220
I don't want my life

15
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:42,220
How did you manage to remain calm towards your mother-in-law?

16
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,220
Remember life is precious

17
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,610
life is precious

18
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:48,610
Then I don’t have to be a toddler anymore?

19
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,610
Don't even think about it

20
00:00:50,610 --> 00:01:00,000
Go lie down on the stone

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,430
Encountered a strong enemy

22
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:06,430
Lord Ling, I was attacked by a fellow surnamed Xiong.

23
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:08,430
Please make the decision for me
